  "description": "Heena, living a typical office life, suddenly finds herself presented with an enticing job opportunity. Lured by the promise of a high salary, she decides to step onto the challenging and chaotic path of becoming a magical girl. But the reality of her new life is far from glamorous. As she juggles relentless overtime, she ends a long-term relationship with her boyfriend of seven years and finds little time—let alone energy—for a new romance. Buried under the weight of her responsibilities, Heena soon finds herself reaching for her magic wand, uncertain of the toll it will take.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5636000033), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11879590), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/magical_wand), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/magic_curl_stick), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066743), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=241168), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70046012), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9103)",
